flowchart TD
Process["Developer / CI test process<br/>.NET runner + libraries<br/>Owns per-test clients / evidence"]
Local["Local browser process<br/>ChromeDriver -> Chrome<br/>Fresh session per case"]
Grid["Optional Selenium Grid<br/>Hub / node -> remote browser<br/>Node must reach app / emulator"]
Services["Optional service processes<br/>PostgreSQL / MailHog<br/>Private test environment"]
SUT["Application endpoints<br/>Sample server or public demos"]
Mock["Owned WireMock server<br/>Random port; no shared reset"]
Process --> Local
Process --> Grid
Process --> Services
Local --> SUT
Grid --> SUT
SUT -->|configured upstream| Mock
